<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Conrail soars on second bid.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Conrail soars on second bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conrail Inc shares dominated Wednesday's pre-open traded with a sharp ascent stoked by Norfolk Southern Corp's $100 per share cash offer for Conrail, a bid intended to derail CSX Corp friendly $92.50 per share merger pact.</p>
<p>Preceding the market open, Conrail shares soared to 98-1/8 from 84-1/2, while traders reported no early moves in CSX or Norfolk Southern.</p>
</text>
